    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321310/extras/012f84d0ebe7459420d515e3cfedf8af.avif?t=1728702514\" /></span><br>Find the hidden cute cats in the relaxing hand-painted town scenery.<br>There are many cats here.<br>Meow Meow\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7Meow Meow\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7<br>Stay with the cats. Don't miss any one.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321310/extras/0b90804c5a3078f5c14b663fb9400070.poster.avif?t=1728702514\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321310/extras/0b90804c5a3078f5c14b663fb9400070.gif?t=1728702514\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><br>\u00b7 Hand-painted minimalist style<br>\u00b7 More than 500 cats<br>\u00b7 With different postures and expressions<br>\u00b7 Explore the small town, from street to roof top<br>\u00b7 Some interesting interactive elements<br>\u00b7 Drag and zoom the screen view<br>\u00b7 Relax and find all the cats<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321310/extras/9d757a028b714b6d745fa8509fb99b80.avif?t=1728702514\" /></span>",
